          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with eight stitch panels, each 56 by 40 holes, arranged in two rows of four. A dark dividing strip separates the panels in both directions. The finished sampler is 25 by 35 cm. Two thread colours: dark and light: run through all eight panels so the stitch structure is clearly readable."
          }
